---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import Card from '../components/blocks/Card.astro';
import { getAllInns } from '../data/inns';

const inns = getAllInns();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Guest Guide | 館内案内"
  description="宿泊施設向け 多言語館内案内サイト（デモ）"
  lang="ja"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-screen-md px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-accent-2)] font-medium">
        Demo
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold">館内案内</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)] leading-relaxed">
        宿泊者向け館内案内のデモサイトです。下記の宿について、日本語・英語ページをご覧いただけます。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        Demo of a multi-lingual in-house guide. Choose an inn below.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="space-y-3">
      {inns.map((inn) => (
        <li>
          <Card>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 flex-wrap">
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <h2 class="font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)] leading-tight">
                  {inn.header.nameJa}
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-muted)] mt-0.5">
                  {inn.header.nameEn}
                </p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-muted)] mt-1 font-mono">
                  /g/{inn.slug}/
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <a
                  href={`/g/${inn.slug}/`}
                  class="tap inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[color:var(--color-accent-2)] text-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[color:var(--color-accent)]"
                >
                  日本語
                </a>
                <a
                  href={`/g/${inn.slug}/en/`}
                  class="tap inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[color:var(--color-border)] bg-[color:var(--color-surface)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[color:var(--color-surface-2)]"
                >
                  English
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </Card>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
      ※ ダミーデータを使用しています。本データやサービスの提供状況は実際の宿泊施設とは関係ありません。
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
